            <note corresp="#d525-f4" n="3" xml:id="d525-f4-content">
                <p>Draft convention extending duration of the Special Claims Commission, not
                    printed. Except for designation of plenipotentiaries, signatures, and dates,
                    this draft is identical with text of convention signed August 17, 1929, <ref
